"\n"
"Do you want to record all payments of this loan with KMyMoney?"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Quere rexistar todos os pagamentos deste empréstimo con KMyMoney?"

#. i18n: file: kmymoney/dialogs/knewloanwizarddecl.ui:1204
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, m_allPaymentsButton)
#: rc.cpp:1493
