#. i18n: file: kmymoney/wizards/newaccountwizard/kaccounttypepagedecl.ui:23
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (K3ActiveLabel, kActiveLabel4)
#: rc.cpp:4346
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Enter the name of the account under which it is known within KMyMoney.\n"
#| "Select the type for the new account. Use the <b>What's this?</b> feature "
#| "to see more details about the various account types.\n"
#| "Enter the date the account was opened and its currency."
