#. i18n: file: kmymoney/wizards/newaccountwizard/kaccounttypepagedecl.ui:40
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KMyMoneySecuritySelector, m_currencyComboBox)
#: rc.cpp:4349
